WEBVTT

00:17:27.371 --> 00:17:30.121
technique we developed, that's
going to go a very long way.

00:17:30.288 --> 00:17:31.538
Now, there's another question,

00:17:31.538 --> 00:17:33.788
which you sort of just kicked the
ball down the field, too,

00:17:33.788 --> 00:17:38.954
which is how do we as a society decide to
which set of human values do we align

00:17:38.954 --> 00:17:40.038
these powerful systems?

00:17:41.913 --> 00:17:45.371
Yeah, indeed. So if I if I understand
rightly what you're saying,

00:17:45.371 --> 00:17:48.829
that you're saying that it's
possible to look at

00:17:49.038 --> 00:17:52.329
the output at any one time of three.

00:17:52.579 --> 00:17:57.704
And if we don't like what it's coming up
with, some ways human can say, no,

00:17:57.871 --> 00:17:59.038
that was off, don't do that.

00:17:59.038 --> 00:18:04.663
Whatever algorithm or process led
you to that, undo it. Yeah.